{"id": "en_wildfire_road_p1", "total": 67.11, "segments": [{"text": "If a wildfire traps you in the forest, never seek shelter inside a wooden cabin.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.4}, {"text": "Cole has only 10 minutes before a raging wall of fire engulfs the timber.", "start": 4.22, "end": 7.2}, {"text": "Heavy black smoke chokes the dusk air as burning embers shower the winding road.", "start": 7.76, "end": 11.04}, {"text": "An evacuation alert sounded earlier, but waiting too long created an extreme survival trap.", "start": 11.48, "end": 15.58}, {"text": "One. Leave early when told to evacuate, because waiting is the most dangerous choice.", "start": 16.28, "end": 20.08}, {"text": "A small wooden cabin stands ahead, but timber shelters quickly burn to the ground.", "start": 20.66, "end": 23.78}, {"text": "Two. If on foot, head immediately for ground with little fuel like bare rock.", "start": 24.4, "end": 28.06}, {"text": "Cole turns his back on the wooden cabin and runs toward a granite clearing.", "start": 28.06, "end": 31.26}, {"text": "Three. Reach the bare stone surface and crouch down low to escape toxic gases.", "start": 31.86, "end": 35.56}, {"text": "Cole drops down flat against the rock, pressing his face to the cold earth.", "start": 36.12, "end": 38.62}, {"text": "A massive firestorm slams the treeline, instantly incinerating the wooden cabin in blinding flames.", "start": 39.18, "end": 43.36}, {"text": "Screaming winds scatter burning debris, but the barren stone gives the inferno zero fuel.", "start": 43.92, "end": 47.58}, {"text": "Cole survived the devastating initial impact because bare mineral ground stopped the advancing blaze.", "start": 48.18, "end": 52.3}, {"text": "It was the perfect plan, executed exactly as required during a deadly forest emergency.", "start": 52.66, "end": 56.34}, {"text": "There was just one problem that destroyed his only chance of waiting it out.", "start": 56.34, "end": 59.62}, {"text": "A massive wall of suffocating radiant heat now forces Cole toward his trapped car.", "start": 60.1, "end": 63.96}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.3], ["a", 0.3, 0.38], ["wildfire", 0.38, 0.76], ["traps", 0.76, 1.06], ["you", 1.06, 1.2], ["in", 1.2, 1.28], ["the", 1.28, 1.34], ["forest,", 1.34, 1.58], ["never", 1.88, 2.02], ["seek", 2.02, 2.28], ["shelter", 2.28, 2.54], ["inside", 2.54, 2.82], ["a", 2.82, 2.98], ["wooden", 2.98, 3.12], ["cabin.", 3.12, 3.4], ["Cole", 4.22, 4.34], ["has", 4.34, 4.56], ["only", 4.56, 4.74], ["10", 4.74, 4.98], ["minutes", 4.98, 5.14], ["before", 5.14, 5.44], ["a", 6.02, 6.12], ["raging", 6.029999999999999, 5.833], ["wall", 6.039999999999999, 6.071], ["of", 6.071, 6.215], ["fire", 6.12, 6.36], ["engulfs", 6.36, 6.9], ["the", 6.9, 7.0], ["timber.", 7.0, 7.2], ["Heavy", 7.76, 7.88], ["black", 7.88, 8.06], ["smoke", 8.06, 8.28], ["chokes", 8.28, 8.68], ["the", 8.68, 8.86], ["dusk", 8.86, 9.1], ["air", 9.1, 9.24], ["as", 9.24, 9.54], ["burning", 9.54, 9.74], ["embers", 9.74, 10.04], ["shower", 10.04, 10.4], ["the", 10.4, 10.58], ["winding", 10.58, 10.78], ["road.", 10.78, 11.04], ["An", 11.48, 11.62], ["evacuation", 11.62, 11.96], ["alert", 11.96, 12.32], ["sounded", 12.32, 12.54], ["earlier,", 12.54, 13.0], ["but", 13.0, 13.34], ["waiting", 13.34, 13.58], ["too", 13.58, 13.78], ["long", 13.78, 13.94], ["created", 13.94, 14.26], ["an", 14.26, 14.46], ["extreme", 14.46, 14.84], ["survival", 14.84, 15.32], ["trap.", 15.32, 15.58], ["One.", 16.28, 16.46], ["Leave", 17.04, 17.22], ["early", 17.22, 17.42], ["when", 17.42, 17.64], ["told", 17.64, 17.82], ["to", 17.82, 17.98], ["evacuate,", 17.98, 18.34], ["because", 18.34, 18.74], ["waiting", 18.74, 19.0], ["is", 19.0, 19.2], ["the", 19.2, 19.26], ["most", 19.26, 19.42], ["dangerous", 19.42, 19.74], ["choice.", 19.74, 20.08], ["A", 20.66, 20.78], ["small", 20.78, 20.96], ["wooden", 20.96, 21.14], ["cabin", 21.14, 21.36], ["stands", 21.36, 21.64], ["ahead,", 21.64, 21.92], ["but", 21.92, 22.2], ["timber", 22.2, 22.46], ["shelters", 22.